DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ttiittmmpp driver provides support for the TI TMP451 temperature sensor.
     The sensor possesses an internal temperature sensor and a link to an ex‐
     ternal temperature sensor.  Both values are made available through the
     sysctl(8) interface.

